' State Diagram 06 — rank_forkchoices fixpoint (termination).
'
' rank_forkchoices(blocks) computes new_blocks by replacing each block with its
' scored children (distinct, then sorted score-desc / hash-asc). If
' still_same(blocks, new_blocks) it returns blocks (the fixpoint); otherwise it
' recurses on new_blocks. Each recursion advances the frontier one level down
' the DAG, so the Σ block-number measure strictly increases and is bounded by
' the DAG height ⟹ termination.
'
' Rocq Rank.rank_terminates ; the empty-tips case is a typed Err
' (Bound.empty_tips_typed_err).
'
' Render:
'   plantuml -tsvg docs/theory/fork-choice/diagrams/06-state-rank-fixpoint.puml

@startuml 06-state-rank-fixpoint
!theme plain

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor  #FFFFFF
  BorderColor      #333333
  ArrowColor       #444444
  FontName         "monospace"
  FontSize         10
}
skinparam legendFontName "monospace"
skinparam legendFontSize 10
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #666666
skinparam defaultFontName "monospace"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title rank_forkchoices fixpoint (termination)

' State color legend:
'   blue   (#BBDEFB) = seed frontier {lca}
'   orange (#FFE0B2) = expand-and-sort frontier (one level)
'   green  (#A5D6A7) = fixpoint reached (accepting)
' Edge color legend:
'   teal  (#00838F) = initial descent
'   blue  (#1565C0) = progress step (measure strictly increases)
'   orange(#E65100) = leaf guard (block keeps self)
'   green (#2E7D32) = fixpoint transition

state "start = {lca}" as Seed #BBDEFB
state "expand to scored children\n(replace each block; distinct;\nsort score DESC, hash ASC)" as Expand #FFE0B2
state "fixpoint = current tips\n(still_same = true ⟹\nnew_blocks == blocks)" as Fix #A5D6A7

[*] -[#00838F]-> Seed
Seed -[#00838F]-> Expand : rank_forkchoices({lca})
Expand -[#1565C0]-> Expand : still_same = false ⟹\nadvance one level;\nΣ block-number STRICTLY increases
Expand -[#E65100]-> Expand : no scored children ⟹\nkeep self (leaf reached)
Expand -[#2E7D32]-> Fix : still_same = true ⟹\nall frontier blocks kept self
Fix -[#2E7D32]-> [*] : return tips

note bottom of Fix
  The strictly-increasing block-number measure is bounded by the DAG
  height ⟹ the recursion terminates (Rocq Rank.rank_terminates).
  The empty-tips case (genesis-only DAG) is a typed Err downstream in
  filter_deep_parents, NOT a panic (Bound.empty_tips_typed_err).
end note

@enduml
